   },
   "metadata": {
    "tags": [
     "runspec",
     "output"
    ],
    "note": "29 rows, all process 1. This is the fixture's pollutant axis AND J25's output gate. Three of the 29 have an nremissionrate row -- 101, 9901 and 10001 -- and the other 26 are fixed multiples of one of those, which is why the rate, the deterioration and the emsadj.f adjustment ride a three-row axis and this one carries the output.",
    "esio_format": "parquet"
