    "note": "The 144-row expected output: the other half of the comparison, shipped in the same snapshot, so no canonical MOVES, MariaDB or JVM is needed to develop against it. Compared under tolerance.toml, whose structural checks stay exact: require_exact_key_set and require_exact_row_count. Matching them means reproducing the reference's row suppression rather than emitting around it -- PLAN.md \u00a71.6.1 measures the alternative at 188 rows against this table's 144.",
    "esio_format": "parquet"
