     "description": "The rung of the equipment chain the .TECH lookup stopped on, carried onto the cohort relation so the contraction against the 9,554-row table joins on a column of ITS OWN range. Reaching the same value through an extra equipment-point range instead costs a factor of six, because that range is not what drives the join."
