      "cohort_rows"
     ],
     "description": "1 for exactly one cohort per emitted (SCC, modelYearID) pair. Summed over the relation it is the number of output rows divided by four, and this fixture's snapshot says that number is 36."
    },
    "cohort_ownerRank": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
