     ],
     "description": "The mix year this cohort takes. 2260007005 resolves to 2008 for all three of its cohorts; 2265007010's bin carries eleven mix years and its 29 cohorts spread across seven of them, down to the 1900 catch-all for model years before 1996, so the 'latest at or before' rule is genuinely exercised here rather than degenerate."
