     "description": "That subtype's share of this county's gasoline supply. The nonroad worker fans one emission out into one per nrFuelSupply entry scaled by its market share (calc/mwo/mworeader.go parseLines); this is that fan-out, carried as a weight.",
     "shape": [
      "tech_category_subtype_rows"
