     "_comment": "The 108 nrsourceusetype rows the RunSpec's sector-4 gasoline SCCs carry, enumerated as nr-logging-county enumerates its six. The list is CHECKED rather than trusted: scc_equipmentPointCount counts, per point, how many nrsourceusetype rows share its SCC and have a base-year population row in this state, and run_selectedEquipmentPointCount counts the whole selected set independently of this list."
    },
    {
     "_comment": "The point's SCC, READ from nrsourceusetype rather than declared. It used to be the `runSCC` parameter, which could hold only one; with six points the SCC is a property of the equipment, and the document now says so. One source type has exactly one row, so the sum_product contraction is a lookup.",
