    {
     "_comment": "adjems, pointwise over the coefficient table: no join, no contraction over anything but the one-row run scope, both shapes imported from lib/adjustments.esm. Temperature and oxygen are run-level, so the eight rows here cover both stroke counts and `pp_adjustment` is what selects between them per equipment point.",
