    {
     "_comment": "nyrlif, as a min-semiring contraction with the 100% test as its filter, capped at MXAGYR for totality. The cap cannot bind: the median life is capped at MXAGYR/2 and the curve reaches 100% at twice the median life.",
     "lhs": "point_equipmentLifeYears",
