     "_comment": "The mix-year rule, per cohort: the LATEST mix year at or before this cohort's model year, within the bin the equipment chain selected. Ten distinct mix years live in 2260007005's bin and eleven in 2265007010's, and the second SCC is where the rule stops being degenerate. THE LOWER HP BOUND IS STRICT, and that is docs/nr-airtoxics-lawn-garden-county.md 2.1(b): nonroad_loader.rs takes the FIRST (SCC, hpMin, hpMax) bin containing hpAvg, and `hpMin <= hpAvg` admits two of them wherever hpAvg sits on a bin boundary -- 2260004071's 3.0 hp is in both (1, 3) and (3, 6) of 2260000000. The bins tile from 0 and every hpAvg is positive, so the strict bound picks exactly the reference's bin; measured over all 108 points at all three chain levels, 0 differences. Without it tech_fractionTotal is 2 on that SCC and its emissions are 1.24 to 1.43 times the reference's."
