        "d"
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "_comment": "The cohort's own age put through 4.1's shape. A technology or pollutant-process with no nrdeterioration row keeps coefficient A = 0 and therefore a factor of exactly 1, which is the reference's `det.get(...)` returning None and leaving (a, b, cap) at their zero values (nonroad_loader.rs:456-460). It is NOT a factor of zero: fuel consumption has no 9901 row anywhere in nrdeterioration, and gating the factor on presence would delete the whole pollutant.",
     "lhs": "tech_deteriorationFactor",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "aggregate",
      "args": [],
      "output_idx": [
       "c",
       "q3",
       "cc"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "c": {
        "from": "cohort_rows"
       },
       "q3": {
        "from": "rated_pp_rows"
       },
       "cc": {
        "from": "engine_tech_rows"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "apply_expression_template",
       "args": [],
       "name": "deterioration_factor",
       "bindings": {
        "coefficient_a": {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "det_coefficient",
          "q3",
          "cc"
         ]
        },
        "age_exponent_b": {
         "op": "ifelse",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": ">",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "det_isPresent",
              "q3",
              "cc"
             ]
            },
            0.0
           ]
          },
          {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "det_ageExponent",
            "q3",
            "cc"
           ]
          },
          1.0
         ]
        },
        "age_cap": {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "det_ageCapValue",
          "q3",
          "cc"
         ]
        },
        "det_age": {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "cohort_detAge",
          "c"
         ]
        }
       }
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "_comment": "clcems.f's product for one cohort and one output pollutant-process, contracted over the technologies the mix carries. Two joins gate it: the cohort's equipment point (summing over points would add different SCCs into one number) and the output row's RATED ROOT, which is what lets 29 pollutant-processes ride three rate blocks.",
     "lhs": "cell_emissionQuant",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "aggregate",
      "args": [],
